{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-279527" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n| $A-(B-C)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-279527" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3-1 & 5-2 \\\\ 0-6 & -4-3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -6 & -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4-2 & -2-3 \\\\ 7-(-6) & 1-(-7)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 13 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-279527" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4005e4a89523fa760e8794a08ecab5d054df6b3638eb6da719e4d0092ffb05b"} {"question" "q-279527" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "c