\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B-(C+B) & =A+B-C-B \\\\  & =A+\\cancel{B}-C-\\cancel{B} \\\\  & =A-C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-C & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}8 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2-8 & -5-(-2) \\\\ 7-(-4) & 0-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -3 \\\\ 11 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-279581" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4005e4a89523fa760e8794a08ecab5d054df6b3638eb6da719e4d0092ffb05b"} {"question" "q-279581" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-279581" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-6"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-279581" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"q