ate.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-13543" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M+O-(N+M) & =M+O-N-M \\\\  & =\\cancel{M}+O-N-\\cancel{M} \\\\  & =O-N\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}O-N & =[\\begin{aligned}8 & 6 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8-1 & 6-4 \\\\ 5-2 & 3-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-13543" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4005e4a89523fa760e8794a08ecab5d054df6b3638eb6da719e4d0092ffb05b"} {"question" "q-13543" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-13543" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "q-13543" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/state.json" "file_sha256" "a1369506410c49b01082ee2534bb5d81132c4ee1841950af3916c6fe046d1eb6"} {"question" "e-4378" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $A-(B-C),$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/example-4378.json" "file_sha256" "d421734353a5017dc885da4bce041f505d9c08aad5db81f73f701ca35e91e3ae"} {"question" "e-4378" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1-0 & -1-(-5) \\\\ 2-1 & 0-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-(-1) & 0-4 \\\\ 2-1 & -2-(-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/example-4378.json" "file_sha256" "d421734353a5017dc885da4bce041f505d9c08aad5db81f73f701ca35e91e3ae"} {"question" "e-4379" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $A+C-(B+A),$ if\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/example-4379.json" "file_sha256" "fe51dfc75e11ae7c7e427dc2ee90bbec7e04288d8098a16f5820460fe4d63570"} {"question" "e-4379" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+C-(B+A) & =A+C-B-A \\\\  & =\\cancel{A}+C-B-\\cancel{A} \\\\  & =C-B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C-B & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3-3 & -1-(-1) \\\\ 1-2 & 2-0 \\\\ -6-(-4) & 1-1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977619/example-4379.json" "file_sha256" "fe51dfc75e11ae7c7e427dc2ee90bbec7e04288d8098a16f5820460fe4d63570"}] "usage" {"q-13536" [] "e-4379" [] "e-4378" []} "basis" 833 "retractions" [[17592186101044 :question/problem "Find $(A + B) - C - (B - C)$, if\n\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186100599 :question/problem "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100599 :question/worked-solution "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA - (B - C) &= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - (\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}-1 - 0 & -1 - (-5) \\\\ 2 - 1 & 0 - 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 - (-1) & 0 - 4 \\\\ 2 - 1 & -2 - (-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186100600 :question/problem "Find $A+C-(B+A)$, if\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100600 :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify the expression by distributing the subtraction over the matrices in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nA + C - (B + A) &= A + C - B - A \\\\\n&= A + C - B - A \\\\\n&= C - B\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are left with a single subtraction. So, we subtract the corresponding entries of the two matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nC - B &= \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}3 - 3 & -1 - (-1) \\\\ 1 - 2 & 2 - 0 \\\\ -6 - (-4) & 1 - 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186098035 17592186098036 17592186098037 17592186098038 17592186098039] "immutable_fields" [[17592186098034 :answer-field/correct] [17592186098034 :answer-field/id] [17592186098034 :answer-field/key] [17592186098034 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
